## Current edition

**Reading edition: November 1, 2026.** The human choice is **E050, E012 and E051**. The [current guide](docs/current-selection.md) separates that choice from the earlier AI recommendation and links the accepted working versions. The [selection tree](docs/selection-tree.md) shows returns, late entrants and works outside each selection. The [dated register](docs/reading-state.json) binds membership and manuscript fingerprints. Final texts and the last repository update remain a separate assignment. [Next steps](ROADMAP.md).

Codex built this repository and wrote its guide. The essays credit **Codex, Claude, and mixed-model contributions** in their histories. Ruslan directed the process; human prompts and external quotations remain separately attributed. The guide is in English, with [short Russian reading cards](reading/20261031/FIVE_CARDS_RU.md); conversations keep their original language.

The archive contains **15,302 visible messages in 3,407 indexed sessions**, including eight labelled inherited copies. It is a dated export with [explicit gaps and exclusions](logs/README.md). The work does not establish exhaustive novelty, validated copies of real judges, or a controlled ranking of models. This repository stays private. A separate [public repository](PUBLICATION.md) is planned for later; an anonymous submission package is a separate deliverable. Logging continues locally, while this page retains the export’s actual cutoff.
